; coverage test for the `thus` keyword: a cheaper alternative to `qed` that closes a `proof`
; block by checking the last formula is literally (up to alpha-equivalence) the planned goal,
; instead of `qed`'s full derivation search.
;
; positive case: the last line of the proof spells out the goal exactly -- `thus` accepts it.
load prop
bool A, B
use A implies B
use A

show B
proof
    B
thus
